      "created_at": "2013-03-25T01:56:13.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I would say yes, since part of the text on the Rod and the Idol say they enter a player's play area. Now if the pin or effect specifies the amount of hero cards in play, then neither the rod nor the idol would count since they are both still environment cards even if they're in a hero's play area.</p>",
